Third-Party Card Artwork Attributions
======================================

Spider Solitaire ships with three sets of card artwork, each vendored from a
permissively-licensed upstream source. The original license text for each deck
is preserved alongside its SVG files in the corresponding subdirectory.


1. Classic deck — ./classic/
   Author: kumanofoo
   Source: https://github.com/kumanofoo/spider
   License: MIT (see ./classic/LICENSE)
   Copyright (c) 2023 kumanofoo


2. Vintage deck — ./vintage/svg-cards.svg
   Author: David Bellot
   Source: http://svg-cards.sourceforge.net/
           (mirrored via https://github.com/htdebeer/SVG-cards)
   License: LGPL-2.1 (see ./vintage/LICENSE)
   Copyright (c) 2001-2012 David Bellot


3. Modern deck — ./modern/
   Author: Byron Knoll
   Source: https://github.com/notpeter/Vector-Playing-Cards
           (originally https://byronknoll.blogspot.com/2011/03/vector-playing-cards.html)
   License: Public domain (see ./modern/LICENSE)
   Note: The Ace of Spades is based on an original by Suzanne Tyson.


The card-back patterns under ./backs/ are original work created for this
project and are licensed under the same terms as the rest of the application.
